cription":"The requested action. Resolves from the flat request attribute (Go adapter) or falls back to $.name of the AuthZEN action JSON (PAZ authzen-servlet).","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null},{"attributeResolverType":"attribute","id":"7f8b1c08-4eba-4ec6-90cc-9a9db0dff16f","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.name","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"0df70c6d-9804-4921-ae33-a05f5ebab92a","version":"421bddbd-0917-4ed1-a344-add7074281af","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"resourceId","fullName":"resourceId","description":"AuthZEN resource.id the grant-evaluation asks about. Resolves from the flat request attribute (Go adapter) or falls back to $.id of the AuthZEN resource JSON (PAZ authzen-servlet).","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null},{"attributeResolverType":"attribute","id":"4f589142-3cab-450f-9323-389ac52786b6","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.id","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"61ab8bb5-d30a-4b5d-88e1-d6f20bfc8179","version":"205a4399-2ad0-4360-aab2-1cde2acdbdf9","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"agentId","fullName":"agentId","description":"GM-API subject (grant's user); AccountHoldings PIP key. Resolves from the flat request attribute (Go adapter) or falls back to $.id of the AuthZEN subject JSON (PAZ authzen-servlet).","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null},{"attributeResolverType":"attribute","id":"e4b4cc88-1aae-4196-bbcc-190621323bb7","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.id","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"ServiceDefinition","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","version":"d56c53d2-37ae-40d7-a1f4-2b81eb1fdc40","type":"SERVICE","name":"ConsentDirectory","fullName":"ConsentDirectory","description":"PIP over the ID Partners consent directory (GET /consents/check): matches subject + amount <= consented + creditor + currency. ASSURANCE WARNING: what this reports is APP-ASSERTED consent — the BFF recorded it after a passkey ceremony that signed a RANDOM challenge, not a signature over this payment. The consent row can be produced without the signature, so it is NOT non-repudiable and would NOT satisfy PSD2 RTS Art.5 dynamic linking. Demo-grade evidence only. See demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md section 2.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"JSON","serviceType":"RESTFUL","secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"serviceSettings":{"serviceSettingsType":"RestSettings","description":"SERVICE: RESTFUL; Verb = GET; Content Type: null","restAuthenticationType":"NONE","urlFormat":"https://proofing-directory-staging.up.railway.app/consents/check?subject={{4983c989-07d6-4664-8845-a47462495b17}}&creditor={{3b666084-491b