nt enumeration source: ALL accounts the authenticated subject holds (open and closed). Keyed on agentId (subject). Feeds heldOpenAccountIds for the entitlement-search rule ('which accounts may I act on?').","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"JSON","serviceType":"RESTFUL","secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"serviceSettings":{"serviceSettingsType":"RestSettings","description":"SERVICE: RESTFUL; Verb = GET; Content Type: null","restAuthenticationType":"NONE","urlFormat":"https://accounts-api-staging.up.railway.app/customers/{{61ab8bb5-d30a-4b5d-88e1-d6f20bfc8179}}/accounts","verb":"GET","headers":[],"responseHandling":{"returnFullResponse":false},"authenticationAttributes":{}},"cacheSettings":null,"serviceResilience":{"maximumConcurrentRequests":2,"maximumRequestsPerSecond":1000000.0,"timeoutMilliseconds":3000,"maximumRetryCount":2,"holdoffMilliseconds":500,"retryStrategy":"BACKOFF","retryJitter":10.0,"circuitBreaker":null},"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"b31b73ce-0b8e-484b-b45e-3af239f06990","version":"0f437dbd-3602-41da-85e6-9a4d41688e2f","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"consent_assurance","fullName":"consent_assurance","description":"The assurance level ACTUALLY ACHIEVED for the consent covering this payment, from the ConsentDirectory PIP ($.assurance). device-signed = a paired device signed over the transaction hash (dynamically linked, artefact retained, PSD2 RTS Art.5-shaped). device-approved = a paired device approved but sent no signature (presence, not agreement). app-asserted = browser passkey signed a RANDOM challenge; the app asserts the rest — NOT non-repudiable. Resolved only for make_payment. Defaults to app-asserted so an unknown level is treated as the WEAKEST, never the strongest.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"app-asserted","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.assurance","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"6e9214c7-7b5f-429f-b772-78fb74eaedc8","version":"fefc9c93-01cc-4c75-9c9b-b6c3293a9ada","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"consent_covered","fullName":"consent_covered","description":"TRUE when the consent directory holds an AUTHORIZED consent for this principal covering this payment (amount <= consented cap, matching creditor and currency). Resolved from the ConsentDirectory PIP's 'covered' field; only resolved for make_payment. ASSURANCE: app-asserted, NOT non-repudiable — the recorded consent is not a signature over this payment (demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md section 2). Defaults to false so a directory outage or timeout fails CLOSED to step-up.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"false","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.covered","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"aadbaf4a-5e99-4d79-8bde-5d60dec0390d","version":"32d2f75b-d1bc-4080-baa3-13fff087190c","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"account_held_open","fullName":"account_held_open","description":"true iff the subject holds the resource account AND it is open (from AccountHoldings). Fail-closed false.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"false","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"d2d8fef0-6510-4e34-b097-ff83c588747e","condition":{"or":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"read_balance"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"read_transactions"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"initiate_payment"}}}}]}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.held_open","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"338f8524-fcbc-44c0-ab9b-980adf3851f9","version":"fc452e62-ac6e-47ab-a885-2adac61e28bc","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"heldOpenAccountIds","fullName":"heldOpenAccountIds","description":"The ids of the subject's OPEN accounts, from the AccountList PIP (json-path filter status==open over $.accounts). The entitlement-search rule returns this set as its statement payload. Fail-closed: defaults to an empty list.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"JSON","defaultValue":"[]","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"903b9f2b-508b-4d01-8a0a-434f5a55d7dd","condition":{"empty":{}},"